After some years university and he know a girl called Kate and he gets loved on here and she gets loved by him .
Kate was cursing the university of fashion .
Then the two started to date .
Michael and Kate were so happy , until one day that Michael said to him dream of being a super hero . Kate got so nervous saying that it was ridiculous and just a kid 's dream and that Michael was only dreaming but that would never happen and that super heroes do n't exist .
When she said that , Michael started to cry and get mad , saying that she was lying and did n't have heart .
He got so mad that he asked her to get out of his apartment .
On the following day , she said sorry and they were happy again .
But when they get to the home of Michael they fight again and Michael gets a knife and kills her .
He cried with a lot of blood around him .
Michael got away from there .
Michael closed the door and knew at that moment he had made a mistake .
